t-images/b31c3117/img_007_5754dfab.png" alt="0 point 5 is less than or equal to p, which is less than or equal to 0 point 8 5"></span>. When <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_008_4ac18373.png" alt="p equals 0 point 5"></span>, <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_009_583c1487.png" alt="H equals, 120 times 0 point 5, plus 60"></span>, or <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_010_123a8f4e.png" alt="H equals 120"></span>. When <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_011_de8ff9e9.png" alt="p equals 0 point 8 5"></span>, <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_012_3d737e23.png" alt="H equals, 120 times 0 point 8 5, plus, 60"></span>, or <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_013_38f8b9b1.png" alt="H equals 162"></span>. Therefore, the inequality that describes Alice&rsquo;s target training heart rate is <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_014_dc05db1a.png" alt="120 is less than or equal to H, which is less than or equal to 162"></span>.<p>Choice B is incorrect. This inequality describes Alice&rsquo;s target heart rate for <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_015_6a8ff226.png" alt="0 point 3 5 is less than or equal to p, which is less than or equal to 0 point 5"></span>. Choice C is incorrect. This inequality describes her target heart rate for <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_016_f07680a1.png" alt="0 is less than or equal to p, which is less than or equal to 0 point 8 5"></span>. Choice D is incorrect. This inequality describes&nbsp; her target heart rate for <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b31c3117/img_017_d0b1696e.png" alt="0 is less than or equal to p, which is less than or equal to 0 point 3 5"></span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
