    ($SATQ$b450ab03$SATQ$, $SATQ$7d5c4716-5975-4df0-abca-00aaa9789ed0$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$617c2fc3-dad3-4abc-82b7-cf88a76c06c5$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Algebra$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, $SATQ$H.C.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Linear equations in two variables$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 1, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">An employee at a restaurant prepares sandwiches and salads. It takes the employee <math alttext="1.5"><mn>1.5</mn>
