</math> can be written in the form <math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals m x plus b"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, where <math alttext="m"><mi>m</mi>
</math> is the slope and <math alttext="left parenthesis 0 comma b right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of <math alttext="y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane. It&rsquo;s given that the graph of <math alttext="y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> has a slope of <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math>. Therefore, <math alttext="m equals 2"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. It&rsquo;s also given that the graph of <math alttext="y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> has a <em>y</em>-intercept at <math alttext="left parenthesis 0 comma negative 5 right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, <math alttext="b equals negative 5"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math> for <math alttext="m"><mi>m</mi>
</math> and <math alttext="negative 5"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn>
</math> for <math alttext="b"><mi>b</mi>
</math> in the equation <math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals m x plus b"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> yields <math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 2 x minus 5"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>. Thus, the equation that defines <math alttext="f"><mi>f</mi>
</math> is <math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 2 x minus 5"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p>
